              "type": "log",
              "text": "{self.name} came to the capital when the summons could no longer be ignored, and knelt, and said the words. No more was offered than was required."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "stay_on_your_own_worlds",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "adjustStress",
              "role": "self",
              "delta": 5
            },
            {
              "type": "log",
              "text": "{self.name} stayed at home and sent a letter. The throne has a long list of things to attend to. The letter is on it."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
